# The raw per-frame captures are 28 MB and REGENERABLE - the exact commands are in
# docs/F26_AVATAR_VS_DEBUG_SKELETON_2026-09-16.md section 11.9 and in ai_handoff.md section 8.
# RESULTS.txt (checked in) carries the analysed numbers the report and ADR-062 actually cite, so the
# citation chain survives without a blob in the repository.
#
# If a future run needs to be kept verbatim - a regression baseline, or a result somebody disputes -
# add an explicit negation for that one file rather than deleting these rules.
*.jsonl
*.jsonl.meta
mark_*.txt
mark_*.txt.meta
first_packet.txt
first_packet.txt.meta
